egated attribute, shaka has a "Tr Tech (30/5)" score of 79, meanings he is likely, relatively to all leaders, to contact you for a tech trade offer, and 79th percentile is a bit short of 80 but still 7 scales/symbols so he will be "#######". If the value is 50 sharp, for raw ai attributes or ai aggregated attributes, the symbol will also be "+++++" or "#####". This is especially important because the last symbol is "=====", which only happens if, for both raw ai attributes and ai aggregated attributes, if all leaders have strictly the same raw value for this attribute aggregated or raw is same in this case functionally, i.e. they'll both get an equal scale symbol, and precisely 5 scales, also all leaders will scale 50. So 50 "+++++", 50 "#####", and 50 "=====" all have different meanings, one being respectively only for raw ai attributes scoring of said leader, the other of similarly same ai aggregated value of said leader, while the last being the display of an equal value among all leaders for an easier read.[PARAGRAPH:2][H2]Category Label -> Internal Key (Exhaustive, by category)[\H2][NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Core Personality:[NEWLINE]- Base Attitude -> getBaseAttitude.[NEWLINE]- Base Peace Weig -> getBasePeaceWeight.[NEWLINE]- Peace Weig Rand -> getPeaceWeightRand.[NEWLINE]- Worse Rank AC -> getWorseRankDifferenceAttitudeChange.[NEWLINE]- Better Rank AC -> getBetterRankDifferenceAttitudeChange.[NEWLINE]- Warmonger Resp -> getWarmongerRespect.[NEWLINE]- CloseBordersSpark -> getCloseBordersAttitudeChange.[NEWLINE]- Same Religion ACL -> getSameReligionAttitudeChangeLimit.[NEWLINE]- Diff.Religion ACL -> getDifferentReligionAttitudeChangeLimit.[NEWLINE]- Favorite Civic ACL -> getFavoriteCivicAttitudeChangeLimit.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]BBAI Victory Weights:[NEWLINE]- Conquest -> getConquestVictoryWeight.[NEWLINE]- Domination -> getDominationVictoryWeight.[NEWLINE]- Culture -> getCultureVictoryWeight.[NEWLINE]- Diplomacy -> getDiplomacyVictoryWeight.[NEWLINE]- Space -> getSpaceVicto